  "title": "Mini Pumpkin Muffins with Orange Drizzle",
  "description": "This mini pumpkin muffins with orange drizzle recipe is spiced with ground ginger, cinnamon, and cloves, and features a bright and tangy orange icing.",
  "authors": [
    "USA WEEKEND columnist Pam Anderson"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:03:56-05:00",
